# Frontend style guide

Match the patterns in `frontend/src/pages/index.astro`, `frontend/src/styles/theme.css`, `frontend/src/styles/global.css`, and `frontend/src/components/SiteMenu/`.

## Tokens (never hardcode colors)

Use CSS variables from `theme.css` and `global.css`:

- Colors: `--site-body-bg`, `--site-body-fg`, `--site-accent`, `--site-border`, `--glassed_background`
- Controls: `--control_min_height`, `--control_min_width`
- Misc: `--border_radius_001`, `--border_001`

Dark/light mode is automatic via `prefers-color-scheme` in `theme.css`. Do not add manual theme toggles unless asked.

## Global baseline

- Import chain: pages/layouts use `global.css` (which imports `theme.css`, `buttons.css`, `headings.css`).
- Font stack: `Raleway, Montserrat, Roboto, system-ui, …` (set on `:root` in `global.css`).
- Universal reset: `* { position: relative; margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }`.
- `body`: `background-color: var(--site-body-bg)`, `color: var(--site-body-fg)`, `max-width: 1920px`, `overflow: hidden`, theme transition `0.3s ease`.
- `input`, `button`, `a`: `min-height/min-width: var(--control_min_*)`, `font-family: inherit`.

## Naming & file organization

- **snake_case** class names: `menu_tray`, `action_button`, `outer_container`.
- **Astro**: colocated `<style>` block in the page/component file.
- **React**: dedicated `.css` file imported at top (`import "./MenuTray.css"`); use `className`, not Tailwind or CSS-in-JS.
- State classes: modifier suffix/prefix pattern — `open_menu_tray`, `menu_button_opened_tray`, `menu_button_top_bar_opened`.

## Layout & responsive

Standard breakpoints (only these unless there is a strong reason):

- `@media (min-width: 768px)`
- `@media (min-width: 1024px)`

Mobile-first: fixed overlays at bottom/top (`position: fixed`), full-width panels. Desktop (`1024px+`): switch to `position: relative`, constrained widths (e.g. `550px` content column), remove glass background where appropriate.

## Components

### Buttons / CTAs (`index.astro` pattern)

```css
.action_button {
  height: var(--control_min_height);
  min-width: var(--control_min_width);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: none;
  font-weight: 700;
  background: var(--site-body-fg);
  color: var(--site-body-bg);
}
```

Primary links inside buttons: `.action_button_link` with `color: inherit`, no underline.

### Glass panels

```css
background: var(--glassed_background);
backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
```

### Text highlights (`index.astro` spans)

Inline keyword chips: `display: inline-flex`, `background: var(--site-body-bg)`, `color: var(--site-body-fg)`, `box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.4)` on mobile; remove shadow on `1024px+`.

### Site menu (`MenuButton`, `MenuTray`)

- Menu button: fixed `top/right: 20px`, square control using `--control_min_height`, `background: var(--site-body-fg)`, bars use `var(--site-body-bg)`.
- Tray: slides from right (`width: 0` → `50%` open; `25%` at `1024px+`), `background: var(--site-body-bg)`, `box-shadow: -5px 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)`.
- Nav links: `color: var(--site-body-fg)`, hover via `font-weight: 900` (not background swaps).
- Hamburger animation: `transition: all 500ms ease`, rotate bars to form X when open.

### Icons (`MenuIcons.jsx`)

- Inline SVG, `20×20` (or `18×14` for hamburger), `stroke="currentColor"` / `fill="currentColor"`, `aria-hidden="true"`.
- Reuse `navIconProps` pattern for nav icons; inherit color from parent.

## Typography

- Headings: heavy weight (`800`), tight line-height in `rem`, `color: var(--site-body-fg)`.
- Body: `font-weight: 600`, `line-height: 2rem`, `font-size: 1rem`; scale up at `1024px+`.

## Do not

- Introduce Tailwind, styled-components, or new color hex values when a token exists.
- Use camelCase CSS class names.
- Add one-off breakpoints (e.g. `640px`, `1280px`) without matching existing pages.
- Override `body` overflow or max-width without checking impact on the fixed home layout and menu tray.
